        "lessons": [
          {
            "title": "Intro",
            "id": 84793,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Es ist an der Zeit, Funktionen zu erstellen, die Entscheidungen treffen. Als erster Schritt wollen wir sehen, wie man bedingte Anweisungen in Funktionen verschachtelt.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "One Indent",
            "id": 84801,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Wir wissen, dass Funktionen Codeblöcke sind. Das bedeutet, dass verschachtelte Anweisungen von geschweiften Klammern umgeben sind und zusätzlichen Platz auf der linken Seite haben.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"displayMessage\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"message\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(message);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"displayMessage(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Approved&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"33\" endIndex=\"34\" /><option startIndex=\"58\" endIndex=\"59\" /><option startIndex=\"36\" endIndex=\"57\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Approved\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>{</code>, gefolgt von <code>console.log(message);</code> und schließlich <code>}</code> aus.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Wir wissen, dass Funktionen Codeblöcke sind. Das bedeutet, dass verschachtelte Anweisungen von geschweiften Klammern umgeben und links zusätzlich eingerückt sind. Vervollständige die Funktion so, dass ihr Aufruf <code>Approved</code> anzeigt.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"displayMessage\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"message\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(message);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"displayMessage(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Approved&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"61\" endIndex=\"75\" /><option startIndex=\"48\" endIndex=\"55\" /><option startIndex=\"33\" endIndex=\"34\" /><option startIndex=\"76\" endIndex=\"86\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"display\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;message&quot;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"(message)\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"Denied\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Approved\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>{</code>, gefolgt von <code>message</code>, <code>displayMessage</code> und schließlich <code>\"Approved\"</code> aus.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Braces and spaces",
            "id": 84797,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Wir können andere Codeblöcke innerhalb einer Funktion hinzufügen. Wenn wir das tun, zeigt uns das zusätzliche Paar geschweifter Klammern, welche Anweisungen wohin gehören.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"isRentingAge\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"age\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (age &gt;= \" /><text value=\"21\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Approved&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"isRentingAge(\" /><text value=\"26\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"75\" endIndex=\"76\" /><option startIndex=\"77\" endIndex=\"78\" /><option startIndex=\"27\" endIndex=\"28\" /><option startIndex=\"45\" endIndex=\"46\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Approved\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>{</code>, gefolgt von <code>{</code> und schließlich <code>}</code>, <code>}</code> aus.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Wir können weitere Codeblöcke in eine Funktion einfügen. Das zusätzliche Paar geschweifter Klammern zeigt uns dann, welche Anweisungen wohin gehören. Vervollständige die verschachtelte Prüfung so, dass ein Mieter im Alter von <code>26</code> zugelassen wird.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"isRentingAge\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"age\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (age &gt;= \" /><text value=\"21\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Approved&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"isRentingAge(\" /><text value=\"26\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"80\" endIndex=\"92\" /><option startIndex=\"34\" endIndex=\"37\" /><option startIndex=\"38\" endIndex=\"40\" /><option startIndex=\"41\" endIndex=\"43\" /><option startIndex=\"45\" endIndex=\"46\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"isRenting\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"==\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"26\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"}\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Approved\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>age</code>, gefolgt von <code>&gt;=</code>, <code>21</code>, <code>{</code> und schließlich <code>isRentingAge</code> aus.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Indenting the entire block",
            "id": 84800,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Der Raum links wird <strong>Einrückung</strong> genannt. Wenn wir einen Codeblock in einen anderen einfügen, wird der gesamte Codeblock um einen Abstand eingerückt.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"displayAlarm\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"time\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (time === \" /><text value=\"&quot;7:00&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Waky waky&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"displayAlarm(\" /><text value=\"&quot;7:00&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"31\" endIndex=\"53\" /><option startIndex=\"56\" endIndex=\"81\" /><option startIndex=\"83\" endIndex=\"84\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Waky waky\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>if (time === \"7:00\") {</code>, gefolgt von <code>console.log(\"Waky waky\");</code> und schließlich <code>}</code> aus.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Der Platz auf der linken Seite wird <strong>Einrückung</strong> genannt. Wenn wir einen Codeblock in einen anderen einfügen, wird der gesamte Codeblock um ein Leerzeichen eingerückt. Vervollständige den verschachtelten Block so, dass bei passender Uhrzeit <code>Waky waky</code> angezeigt wird.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"displayAlarm\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"time\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (time === \" /><text value=\"&quot;7:00&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Waky waky&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"displayAlarm(\" /><text value=\"&quot;7:00&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"35\" endIndex=\"39\" /><option startIndex=\"40\" endIndex=\"43\" /><option startIndex=\"101\" endIndex=\"107\" /><option startIndex=\"56\" endIndex=\"81\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"=\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;8:00&quot;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"console.log(time);\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"==\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Waky waky\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>time</code>, gefolgt von <code>===</code>, <code>console.log(\"Waky waky\");</code> und schließlich <code>\"7:00\"</code> aus.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Code blocks",
            "id": 84796,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Das Einbetten von <code>if</code>-Anweisungen in Funktionen hilft uns, unseren Code zu organisieren und wiederzuverwenden. Jetzt können wir dieselbe <code>if</code>-Anweisung mit einem Funktionsaufruf verwenden.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"isRentingAge\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"age\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (age &gt;= \" /><text value=\"21\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Approved&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"isRentingAge(\" /><text value=\"26\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"80\" endIndex=\"92\" /><option startIndex=\"92\" endIndex=\"93\" /><option startIndex=\"93\" endIndex=\"95\" /><option startIndex=\"95\" endIndex=\"96\" /><option startIndex=\"96\" endIndex=\"97\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Approved\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>isRentingAge</code>, gefolgt von <code>(</code> und schließlich <code>26</code>, <code>)</code>, <code>;</code> aus.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Wenn wir <code>if</code>-Anweisungen in Funktionen einbetten, können wir unseren Code besser organisieren und wiederverwenden. Nun können wir dieselbe <code>if</code>-Anweisung mit einem Funktionsaufruf verwenden. Rufe die Funktion mit einem Alter auf, bei dem sie <code>Approved</code> anzeigt.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"isRentingAge\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"age\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (age &gt;= \" /><text value=\"21\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Approved&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"isRentingAge(\" /><text value=\"26\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"80\" endIndex=\"92\" /><option startIndex=\"34\" endIndex=\"37\" /><option startIndex=\"38\" endIndex=\"40\" /><option startIndex=\"41\" endIndex=\"43\" /><option startIndex=\"93\" endIndex=\"95\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"isRenting\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"score\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"==\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"20\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Approved\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>age</code>, gefolgt von <code>&gt;=</code>, <code>21</code>, <code>isRentingAge</code> und schließlich <code>26</code> aus.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Multiple instructions",
            "id": 85787,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Anweisungen außerhalb von verschachtelten Codeblöcken werden weiterhin ausgeführt, auch wenn der Code innerhalb der Bedingungsanweisung übersprungen wird.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"isRentingAge\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"age\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (age &gt;= \" /><text value=\"21\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Approved&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Check Complete&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"isRentingAge(\" /><text value=\"20\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"Check Complete\" /></content></output></code></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: One indent",
            "id": 85825,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Was passiert, wenn wir eine <code>if</code>-Anweisung in eine Funktion einfügen?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Wir fügen einen Codeblock in einen anderen Codeblock ein</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Die Funktion wird den <code>if</code>-Block überspringen, wenn sie aufgerufen wird</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wir fügen einen Codeblock in einen anderen Codeblock ein.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Eine Funktion hat bereits ihren eigenen Codeblock. Welche Struktur erzeugst du, wenn du darin eine <code>if</code>-Anweisung einfügst?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Einen Codeblock in einem anderen Codeblock</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Eine zweite Funktion, die separat ausgeführt wird</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Eine Bedingung, die die Funktion immer überspringt</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Einen Codeblock in einem anderen Codeblock.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Braces and spaces",
            "id": 85824,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Wie viele Anweisungen außerhalb der <code>if</code>-Anweisung hat diese Funktion?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"isRentingAge\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"age\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (age &gt;= \" /><text value=\"21\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Approved&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Check done&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"isRentingAge(\" /><text value=\"15\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"Check done\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Eine Anzeigeanweisung</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Keine, alle Anweisungen sind Teil der <code>if</code>-Anweisung</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Eine Anzeigeanweisung.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Welche Zeile wird angezeigt, wenn diese Funktion mit <code>15</code> aufgerufen wird?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"isRentingAge\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"age\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (age &gt;= \" /><text value=\"21\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Approved&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Check done&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"isRentingAge(\" /><text value=\"15\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"Check done\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Nur <code>Check done</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Nur <code>Approved</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>Approved</code>, gefolgt von <code>Check done</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle Nur <code>Check done</code> aus.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Indenting the entire block",
            "id": 85826,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Wie nennt man den Raum links von einer verschachtelten Anweisung?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Einrückung</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Ein Codeblock</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle Einrückung aus.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Eine Anweisung wird um ein Leerzeichen nach rechts verschoben, weil sie in einen anderen Codeblock gehört. Wie nennt man diesen zusätzlichen Abstand?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Einrückung</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Einen Funktionsaufruf</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Eine Bedingung</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle Einrückung aus.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Code blocks",
            "id": 85827,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Warum ist es nützlich, Bedingungsanweisungen in Funktionen zu verpacken?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Es hilft uns, unseren Code zu organisieren und wiederzuverwenden</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Es ist nicht so, es ist dasselbe, als ob wir jedes Mal eine <code>if</code>-Anweisung neu schreiben, wenn wir sie brauchen</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Es hilft uns, unseren Code zu organisieren und wiederzuverwenden.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Du brauchst dieselbe Altersprüfung an mehreren Stellen. Warum solltest du diese <code>if</code>-Anweisung in eine Funktion einfügen?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Du kannst die Prüfung organisieren und mit Funktionsaufrufen wiederverwenden</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Die Bedingung wird dann ohne Funktionsaufruf ausgeführt</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Du musst die Bedingung für jede Verwendung neu schreiben</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Du kannst die Prüfung organisieren und mit Funktionsaufrufen wiederverwenden.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Multiple instructions",
            "id": 85828,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Welche Anzeigeanweisung wird ausgeführt, wenn <code>isLying(false)</code> aufgerufen wird?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"isLying\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"boolean\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Welcome to the Lie Detector 3000&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (boolean === \" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;He's lying&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"isLying(\" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"Welcome to the Lie Detector 3000\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"He's lying\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Beide Anzeigeanweisungen werden ausgeführt</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Nur die zweite Display-Anweisung wird ausgeführt</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Beide Anzeigeanweisungen werden ausgeführt.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Der Aufruf übergibt <code>false</code>. In welcher Reihenfolge zeigt das Programm seine Meldungen an?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"isLying\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"boolean\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Welcome to the Lie Detector 3000&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (boolean === \" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;He's lying&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"isLying(\" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"Welcome to the Lie Detector 3000\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"He's lying\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>Welcome to the Lie Detector 3000</code>, dann <code>He's lying</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Nur <code>He's lying</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>He's lying</code>, dann <code>Welcome to the Lie Detector 3000</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>Welcome to the Lie Detector 3000</code>, dann <code>He's lying</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: One Indent",
            "id": 85830,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Verschachtle die <code>if</code>-Anweisung innerhalb der Funktion.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"hasPassed\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"score\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (score &gt;= \" /><text value=\"50\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Passed&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"hasPassed(\" /><text value=\"80\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"26\" endIndex=\"27\" /><option startIndex=\"46\" endIndex=\"47\" /><option startIndex=\"74\" endIndex=\"75\" /><option startIndex=\"76\" endIndex=\"77\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"(\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\")\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>{</code>, gefolgt von <code>{</code> und schließlich <code>}</code>, <code>}</code> aus.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Ein verschachtelter Block liegt in einem anderen Block und hat eigene geschweifte Klammern und eine zusätzliche Einrückung.</p><p>Lass nur Punktzahlen ab <code>50</code> bestehen. Vergleiche <code>score</code>, ohne es zu ändern, und rufe die Funktion mit <code>80</code> auf, um <code>Passed</code> auszugeben.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"hasPassed\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"score\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (score &gt;= \" /><text value=\"50\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Passed&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"hasPassed(\" /><text value=\"80\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"79\" endIndex=\"88\" /><option startIndex=\"33\" endIndex=\"38\" /><option startIndex=\"39\" endIndex=\"41\" /><option startIndex=\"42\" endIndex=\"44\" /><option startIndex=\"50\" endIndex=\"72\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"hasFailed\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"=\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"80\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"console.log(score);\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Passed\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>score</code>, gefolgt von <code>&gt;=</code>, <code>50</code>, <code>console.log(\"Passed\");</code> und schließlich <code>hasPassed</code> aus.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Braces and spaces",
            "id": 85831,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Zeige nur <code>\"Checking Score\"</code> in der Konsole an, indem du es außerhalb der <code>if</code>-Anweisung platzierst.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"hasFailed\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"score\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Checking Score&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (score &lt;= \" /><text value=\"50\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Failed&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"hasFailed(\" /><text value=\"80\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"41\" endIndex=\"57\" /><option startIndex=\"94\" endIndex=\"102\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Checking Score\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>\"Checking Score\"</code>, gefolgt von <code>\"Failed\"</code> aus.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Punktzahlen bis einschließlich <code>50</code> fallen durch. Vergleiche <code>score</code> links mit diesem Grenzwert rechts.</p><p>Prüfe die Zahl <code>80</code>, damit die Funktion nur <code>Checking Score</code> anzeigt.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"hasFailed\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"score\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Checking Score&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (score &lt;= \" /><text value=\"50\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Failed&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"hasFailed(\" /><text value=\"80\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"65\" endIndex=\"70\" /><option startIndex=\"71\" endIndex=\"73\" /><option startIndex=\"74\" endIndex=\"76\" /><option startIndex=\"41\" endIndex=\"57\" /><option startIndex=\"121\" endIndex=\"123\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&gt;=\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;Failed&quot;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"false\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"console.log(score);\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Checking Score\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>\"Checking Score\"</code>, gefolgt von <code>score</code>, <code>&lt;=</code>, <code>50</code> und schließlich <code>80</code> aus.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Indenting the entire block",
            "id": 85832,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Zeige beide Nachrichten in der Konsole an.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"isLying\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"boolean\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (boolean === \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;He's not lying&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Done&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"isLying(\" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"122\" endIndex=\"126\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"false\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"He's not lying\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Done\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>true</code> aus.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Prüfe, ob der boolesche Parameter gleich <code>true</code> ist, ohne ihn zu ändern.</p><p>Rufe die Funktion so auf, dass sie vor <code>Done</code> den Text <code>He's not lying</code> anzeigt.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"isLying\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"boolean\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (boolean === \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;He's not lying&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Done&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"isLying(\" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"33\" endIndex=\"40\" /><option startIndex=\"41\" endIndex=\"44\" /><option startIndex=\"122\" endIndex=\"126\" /><option startIndex=\"55\" endIndex=\"85\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"false\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"=\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"console.log(&quot;Done&quot;);\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;true&quot;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"He's not lying\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Done\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>boolean</code>, gefolgt von <code>===</code>, <code>console.log(\"He's not lying\");</code> und schließlich <code>true</code> aus.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Code blocks",
            "id": 85833,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Erhöhe <code>salary</code> um 500, wenn es weniger als 2100 ist. Zeige <code>salary</code> am Ende der Funktion an.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"displaySalary\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"salary\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (salary &lt; \" /><text value=\"2100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  salary = salary + \" /><text value=\"500\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(salary);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"displaySalary(\" /><text value=\"2000\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"57\" endIndex=\"79\" /><option startIndex=\"84\" endIndex=\"104\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"2500\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>salary = salary + 500;</code>, gefolgt von <code>console.log(salary);</code> aus.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Ein Gehalt unter <code>2100</code> wird um <code>500</code> erhöht. Beginne mit <code>2000</code>, damit nach der Erhöhung <code>2500</code> angezeigt wird.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"displaySalary\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"salary\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (salary &lt; \" /><text value=\"2100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  salary = salary + \" /><text value=\"500\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(salary);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"displaySalary(\" /><text value=\"2000\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"45\" endIndex=\"46\" /><option startIndex=\"47\" endIndex=\"51\" /><option startIndex=\"57\" endIndex=\"79\" /><option startIndex=\"122\" endIndex=\"126\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"-\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"salary = 500;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"2500\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"2500\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>&lt;</code>, gefolgt von <code>2100</code>, <code>salary = salary + 500;</code> und schließlich <code>2000</code> aus.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Multiple instructions",
            "id": 85834,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Reduziere das <code>salary</code> um 500, nur wenn es größer als 2100 ist.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"getTaxedSalary\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"salary\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (salary &gt; \" /><text value=\"2100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  salary = salary - \" /><text value=\"500\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" salary;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" income = getTaxedSalary(\" /><text value=\"2100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(income);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"46\" endIndex=\"47\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"===\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"2100\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>&gt;</code> aus.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Ziehe <code>500</code> nur von Gehältern über <code>2100</code> ab. Gib das Gehalt zurück, unabhängig davon, ob es sich ändert.</p><p>Rufe die Funktion mit <code>2100</code> auf, damit das angezeigte Einkommen bei <code>2100</code> bleibt.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"getTaxedSalary\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"salary\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (salary &gt; \" /><text value=\"2100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  salary = salary - \" /><text value=\"500\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" salary;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" income = getTaxedSalary(\" /><text value=\"2100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(income);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"58\" endIndex=\"64\" /><option startIndex=\"46\" endIndex=\"47\" /><option startIndex=\"133\" endIndex=\"137\" /><option startIndex=\"85\" endIndex=\"99\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&gt;=\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"500\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"return income;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"2100\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>&gt;</code>, gefolgt von <code>salary</code>, <code>return salary;</code> und schließlich <code>2100</code> aus.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
